From: OWzx <owzx@local>
Subject: [PATCH 0020] fix(engine): bind GCode::m_print before the do_export early return

fix(engine): bind GCode::m_print before the do_export early return

Print::export_gcode unconditionally calls export_layer_filaments(result)
after do_export, and export_layer_filaments dereferences m_print
(assigned only in _do_export). On a persistent-print reuse reslice the
psGCodeExport step is already done and the target file exists, so
do_export early-returns WITHOUT running _do_export -- m_print stays null
and export_layer_filaments segfaults at
m_print->get_slice_used_mixed_filaments() (vector<unsigned int>
copy-assign reading a null FullPrintConfig at +0x4cc0). Bind m_print
before the early return; the early return itself stays (it keeps the
valid first-pass gcode file).
diff --git a/src/libslic3r/GCode.cpp b/src/libslic3r/GCode.cpp
--- a/src/libslic3r/GCode.cpp
+++ b/src/libslic3r/GCode.cpp
@@ -2852,6 +2852,15 @@ void GCode::do_export(Print* print, const char* path, GCodeProcessorRes
 void GCode::do_export(Print* print, const char* path, GCodeProcessorResult* result, ThumbnailsGeneratorCallback thumbnail_cb)
 {
+    // OWzx (2026-11-11): bind m_print BEFORE the done-step early return.
+    // Print::export_gcode unconditionally calls export_layer_filaments(result)
+    // after do_export, and that function dereferences m_print (assigned only
+    // in _do_export). On a persistent-print reuse reslice the psGCodeExport
+    // step is already done and the target file exists, so the early return
+    // below skipped _do_export, left m_print null, and
+    // m_print->get_slice_used_mixed_filaments() segfaulted on the E2E
+    // persistent-reuse reslice.
+    m_print = print;
     PROFILE_CLEAR();
 
     // BBS
     m_curr_print = print;
